        "original_id": "76bc0321-00b8-5adb-a8f1-1a1b09c17dcd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: FC Barcelona, AC Milan, UEFA Champions League\n- People: Daniele Massaro, Dejan Savićević, Marcel Desailly\n- Events: 1993–94 FC Barcelona season, UEFA Champions League final\n- Topics: football, domestic league, player biography\n\nFacts:\n- During the 1993–94 FC Barcelona season, FC Barcelona retained its domestic league supremacy and reached the UEFA Champions League final.\n- In the UEFA Champions League final of the 1993–94 season, AC Milan defeated FC Barcelona 4–0.\n- In that final, AC Milan's goals were scored by Daniele Massaro, Dejan Savićević, and Marcel Desailly.\n- Daniele Emilio Massaro was born on 23 May 1961.\n- Daniele Massaro is an Italian former footballer who played as a forward.",
